@Grounded.Hexagonal.Host.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5193

### GetInventory
# Con la composición In-Memory vacía por defecto, un GUID no registrado devuelve 404.
GET {{Grounded.Hexagonal.Host.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### CraftItem
# Sin datos seed por defecto, los repositorios In-Memory no contienen esta receta/jugador.
POST {{Grounded.Hexagonal.Host.Api_HostAddress}}/api/crafting/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "recipeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

